        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli Saulo guri báy, «AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aníng ina amoorógí ya/aáw uwa iimbalaax ar di/i as kahhó' kuúng tawa waawutmoó múk Israeli, gimáy, daxta afór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iiárií qaaseek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo i kaahi, ‹Múk Amaleki u slaáhh asma inooín múk Israeli iwa Misrír dahhi nguna saga'ayé' loohírií ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tláw múk Amaleki tsu/eek, nee muruuín sleémeero oo taqo kona hhaamiiseek, tam panmo sleeme miwa meét, /ameena nee hhawaateewo tsu/eek, mindiwa meetiyé', nee sleeme tam na/ii nee qaweerowo, hikwa nee bee/aango, angamía nee daqwaayeero sleémeero qororo'ooseek.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo muu guri ateét baraá Telaimu, guri faár, hhawaataá slaqwara awa ya'ár hi'iitá' awa Israeli a kume tsiire tsár, nee awa Yuda a kume mibaangw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo gixsár Amaleki gari haradáh, iri baraá xatstá wa giír. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo múk Keni guri báy, «Gimsé', tlawé' ti paratle' dír múk Amalekiro, aníng kuungá' munduwa dinkwaárí hhaamiís nee inooín, asma kuungá' múk Israeli una hhoeemáy tlehhé' qoomár niwa ti'iitiyé' Misrír wa ale.» Naagáy múk Keni tari tláy, tiri paraatliyé' dír múk Amalekiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo múk Amaleki guri baál iimír yaamaá Hafilár wa ale ay awa Shuri, ti'inángw da/aáw oo Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agagi waawutmoó múk Amaleki guna slafi óh, ala múk hatlá' sleémeero guna hhaamiís ar paánga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Saulo nee mukós Agagi kunguri slafi huúw, kwa gaasiiká, nee bee/ángw slaqo hhó', nee hikwaá slaqo hho' nee muruú wahhaara, nee deeloó bee/aango nee umuúqo gár slaqwahhooe, aa ya/aniká ngiwa hhaamisi. Ala muruuduú kangaa/a nee muruú slaqo tlákw, an kudá' taa hhaamiís.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Samueli guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aga gwadidiím, asma Saulo nguwa waawutmoó wa qaás, asma inós aníng iga máy eeharto nee hara'ayar'eé' gaa boo/eesiiká.» Samueli iri buúhh, iri /aa/aá áy dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ xweera sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli matlaatlér boo/e iri ti'iít amór Saulo. Samueli kuri báy, «Saulo i Karmelír daahh, ga/aaweek, gár iinslaslaangw gaa sihhtís, iri waaraáhh Gilgali.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli iri daqáy amór Saulo, Saulo iri oó', «AAKOÓ MUNGÚ u tsuuqi daxta aníng hara'ayár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aga boo/eés.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli iri oó', «Kár /aa/eekaá bee/aangw nee aahhoorír hikwa iaaeene ni axamiis ar milá?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo iri oó', «Kingina huúw amór múk Amalekír wa alé, asma muu bee/aangw nee hikwawo kingina slafi huúw as kiwa ilahhooár wa tsu/i dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwók, nee awa naa meetiye' ina kángw kilá' wa hhaamisaán.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli Saulo guri báy, «Lakiít, aníng ngi oó' gár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ naa aníng báy xweerakae.» Inós guri báy, «Ooang.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli iri oó', «Tam geera kuúng tiwa ga/eer tu niinawe, xáy, taa ureésiíke tawa geeraharusmoó tlahh'aá múk Israeli. Nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ uri iimbalaáx ar di/i tawa waawutmoó múk Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ uri ya/aáw as gadiyeérós iwa oó', ‹Tláw mukduú Amaleki oo tlakuuse tsu/a/imeek ay dír kway hhaamis.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaá a milá ala afór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ masa ilaiwa/iká? Waáy gár taa hara/akút mas haasaáng, tlakweema kiri tléhh dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo Samueli guri báy, «Kángw loe aníng afór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aga ilaiwaá/, gár naa tleéhh aqo tidá' tiwa ya/aáw nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Agagi waawutmoó múk Amaleki nguna huúw, múk Amaleki ugwa hhamiís kángw kilae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala muu haasaáng nguna huúw, bee/aangw nee aweedá' hhoe nee muruudá' hhohhó', taa amaasli as kuwa ilahhooár wa tsu/i dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwók, amoodár Gilgalír wa ale.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo Samueli guri báy, «Tlakweema iga tleéhh, asma hara'ayár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aga sii', tam axweesantók sleeme aga ilaiwa/iiká, asma muu una da'ayuút, afor'ín ngiri ilaiwaá/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala hamí un firiím tlakweemaaeé' gurtlaweek, qwaláng a alki/aán, as kahhó' aleesleemu nguwa slaw, oo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguwa sluufmiis.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
